{"format":"revizio-pack","version":1,"courses":[{"level":"CM2","subject":"maths","catalogTitle":"Grands nombres","title":"Grands nombres","duration":20,"summary":"Nombres jusqu'au million et au-delà : lire, écrire, comparer, arrondir.","objectives":["Lire et écrire les grands nombres","Comparer","Arrondir"],"prerequisites":["Nombres à 6 chiffres"],"pitfalls":["Oublier un zéro","Arrondir dans le mauvais sens"],"lesson":[{"title":"Lire et écrire","content":"Un nombre se lit par classes de trois chiffres : unités, milliers, millions, milliards. 2 345 678 : deux millions trois cent quarante-cinq mille six cent soixante-dix-huit.","examples":["1 000 000 = un million","1 000 000 000 = un milliard"]},{"title":"Comparer","content":"On compare le nombre de chiffres puis chiffre à chiffre en partant de la gauche.","examples":["1 250 000 > 987 654"]},{"title":"Arrondir","content":"Arrondir à la dizaine, centaine, millier : on regarde le chiffre suivant. 5 ou plus : on augmente. Moins de 5 : on garde.","examples":["3 462 arrondi à la centaine : 3 500","3 462 arrondi au millier : 3 000"]}],"keyPoints":["Classes de trois chiffres","Comparer de gauche à droite","Arrondir : 5 ou plus on monte"],"cards":[{"q":"1 million ?","a":"1 000 000 (6 zéros)","explain":"","tag":""},{"q":"1 milliard ?","a":"1 000 000 000 (9 zéros)","explain":"","tag":""},{"q":"Arrondi de 3 462 à la centaine","a":"3 500","explain":"","tag":""},{"q":"Arrondi de 3 462 au millier","a":"3 000","explain":"","tag":""},{"q":"Combien de milliers dans 1 million ?","a":"1 000","explain":"","tag":""},{"q":"Que signifie > ?","a":"plus grand que","explain":"","tag":""},{"q":"Valeur du 7 dans 7 250 000 ?","a":"7 millions","explain":"","tag":""},{"q":"Ordre décroissant ?","a":"Du plus grand au plus petit","explain":"","tag":""}],"questions":[{"type":"calcul","q":"Arrondis 3 462 à la centaine.","answer":"3500","explanation":"Chiffre suivant : 6.","level":1,"skill":"arrondir","hint":""},{"type":"calcul","q":"Arrondis 3 462 au millier.","answer":"3000","explanation":"Chiffre suivant : 4.","level":1,"skill":"arrondir","hint":""},{"type":"calcul","q":"Combien de milliers dans 1 000 000 ?","answer":"1000","explanation":"1 million = 1 000 milliers.","level":2,"skill":"valeur","hint":""},{"type":"qcm","q":"Quel nombre est le plus grand ?","choices":["987 654","1 250 000","999 999","100 000"],"answer":1,"explanation":"7 chiffres.","level":1,"skill":"comparer"},{"type":"ordre","q":"Range du plus petit au plus grand.","items":["45 000","450 000","4 500 000","45 000 000"],"explanation":"Nombre de chiffres.","level":1,"skill":"ranger"},{"type":"vf","q":"Un milliard s'écrit avec 9 zéros.","answer":true,"explanation":"1 000 000 000.","level":1,"skill":"écrire"},{"type":"trous","q":"Dans 7 250 000, le 7 vaut 7 ___.","answer":"millions","accept":["million"],"explanation":"Position.","level":2,"skill":"valeur"},{"type":"assoc","q":"Relie chaque nombre à son écriture en lettres.","pairs":[["2 000 000","deux millions"],["200 000","deux cent mille"],["20 000","vingt mille"]],"explanation":"Zéros.","level":2,"skill":"lire"}]},{"level":"CM2","subject":"maths","catalogTitle":"Les quatre opérations","title":"Les quatre opérations","duration":25,"summary":"Multiplication et division posées; calcul mental; problèmes à étapes.","objectives":["Poser × et ÷","Calcul mental","Résoudre un problème à étapes"],"prerequisites":["Tables"],"pitfalls":["Oublier un décalage","Reste mal interprété"],"lesson":[{"title":"Multiplication posée","content":"On multiplie par chaque chiffre du multiplicateur, avec un décalage (0 pour les dizaines, 00 pour les centaines), puis on additionne.","examples":["125 × 34 = 4 250"]},{"title":"Division posée","content":"Avec un diviseur à 2 chiffres : on estime le quotient, on multiplie, on soustrait, on descend le chiffre suivant. Le reste est inférieur au diviseur.","examples":["525 ÷ 21 = 25"]},{"title":"Problèmes à étapes","content":"On lit, on repère les données, on décide des calculs dans l'ordre, on vérifie la vraisemblance, on rédige une phrase réponse.","examples":["3 paquets de 12 + 5 → 41"]}],"keyPoints":["Décalage en multiplication","Reste < diviseur","Phrase réponse"],"cards":[{"q":"125 × 34 =","a":"4 250","explain":"","tag":""},{"q":"525 ÷ 21 =","a":"25","explain":"","tag":""},{"q":"Le produit ?","a":"Résultat d'une multiplication","explain":"","tag":""},{"q":"Le quotient ?","a":"Résultat d'une division","explain":"","tag":""},{"q":"Calcul mental 25 × 4","a":"100","explain":"","tag":""},{"q":"Calcul mental 99 × 3","a":"297 (100×3 − 3)","explain":"","tag":""},{"q":"Dividende = ?","a":"diviseur × quotient + reste","explain":"","tag":""},{"q":"Dernière étape d'un problème ?","a":"Phrase réponse","explain":"","tag":""}],"questions":[{"type":"calcul","q":"125 × 34 =","answer":"4250","explanation":"125×4=500 ; 125×30=3750.","level":2,"skill":"multiplication","hint":""},{"type":"calcul","q":"525 ÷ 21 =","answer":"25","explanation":"21 × 25.","level":2,"skill":"division","hint":""},{"type":"calcul","q":"25 × 4 =","answer":"100","explanation":"Mental.","level":1,"skill":"mental","hint":""},{"type":"calcul","q":"99 × 3 =","answer":"297","explanation":"100×3−3.","level":2,"skill":"mental","hint":""},{"type":"calcul","q":"Quotient entier de 100 ÷ 7 ?","answer":"14","explanation":"7×14=98.","level":2,"skill":"euclidienne","hint":""},{"type":"calcul","q":"Reste de 100 ÷ 7 ?","answer":"2","explanation":"100−98.","level":2,"skill":"euclidienne","hint":""},{"type":"vf","q":"Le reste peut être plus grand que le diviseur.","answer":false,"explanation":"Toujours plus petit.","level":1,"skill":"division"},{"type":"qcm","q":"3 paquets de 12 biscuits et 5 biscuits en plus : combien en tout ?","choices":["36","41","17","39"],"answer":1,"explanation":"3×12+5.","level":2,"skill":"problème"}]},{"level":"CM2","subject":"maths","catalogTitle":"Fractions","title":"Fractions","duration":25,"summary":"Fractions égales, comparer, fraction d'une quantité, fractions décimales.","objectives":["Fractions égales","Comparer","Fraction d'une quantité"],"prerequisites":["Fractions simples"],"pitfalls":["Additionner les dénominateurs"],"lesson":[{"title":"Fractions égales","content":"On ne change pas une fraction en multipliant ou divisant numérateur et dénominateur par le même nombre : 1/2 = 2/4 = 5/10.","examples":["3/6 = 1/2"]},{"title":"Comparer","content":"Même dénominateur : on compare les numérateurs. Sinon on met au même dénominateur. On compare aussi à 1.","examples":["3/8 < 5/8","1/2 < 3/4"]},{"title":"Fraction d'une quantité et décimales","content":"3/4 de 20 : 20 ÷ 4 × 3 = 15. Une fraction décimale a pour dénominateur 10, 100, 1000 : 7/10 = 0,7 ; 25/100 = 0,25.","examples":["3/5 de 40 = 24"]}],"keyPoints":["Même coefficient en haut et en bas","Fraction décimale = dénominateur 10, 100…","n × a/b = (n ÷ b) × a"],"cards":[{"q":"1/2 = ?/10","a":"5/10","explain":"","tag":""},{"q":"3/6 simplifie en","a":"1/2","explain":"","tag":""},{"q":"7/10 en décimal","a":"0,7","explain":"","tag":""},{"q":"25/100 en décimal","a":"0,25","explain":"","tag":""},{"q":"3/4 de 20 ?","a":"15","explain":"","tag":""},{"q":"3/5 de 40 ?","a":"24","explain":"","tag":""},{"q":"Fraction > 1 ?","a":"Numérateur > dénominateur","explain":"","tag":""},{"q":"Comparer 1/2 et 3/4","a":"1/2 < 3/4","explain":"","tag":""}],"questions":[{"type":"calcul","q":"3/4 de 20 =","answer":"15","explanation":"20÷4×3.","level":1,"skill":"quantité","hint":""},{"type":"calcul","q":"3/5 de 40 =","answer":"24","explanation":"40÷5×3.","level":2,"skill":"quantité","hint":""},{"type":"calcul","q":"7/10 s'écrit en décimal :","answer":"0.7","explanation":"7 dixièmes.","level":1,"skill":"décimale","hint":""},{"type":"short","q":"Simplifie 3/6.","answer":"1/2","accept":[],"explanation":"÷3.","level":1,"skill":"égales"},{"type":"qcm","q":"Quelle fraction est la plus grande ?","choices":["1/2","3/4","2/5","1/3"],"answer":1,"explanation":"0,75.","level":2,"skill":"comparer"},{"type":"vf","q":"2/4 = 1/2.","answer":true,"explanation":"÷2.","level":1,"skill":"égales"},{"type":"assoc","q":"Relie chaque fraction à son décimal.","pairs":[["1/2","0,5"],["1/4","0,25"],["3/4","0,75"],["1/10","0,1"]],"explanation":"Équivalences.","level":2,"skill":"décimale"},{"type":"trous","q":"1/2 = ___/10","answer":"5","accept":[],"explanation":"×5.","level":1,"skill":"égales"}]},{"level":"CM2","subject":"maths","catalogTitle":"Nombres décimaux","title":"Nombres décimaux","duration":25,"summary":"Écriture, comparaison, addition, soustraction, multiplication par 10, 100, 1 000.","objectives":["Comparer","Calculer avec des décimaux","Multiplier par 10, 100, 1 000"],"prerequisites":["Fractions décimales"],"pitfalls":["Aligner les virgules","Décaler dans le mauvais sens"],"lesson":[{"title":"Écriture et comparaison","content":"3,25 = 3 unités, 2 dixièmes, 5 centièmes. On compare partie entière, puis dixièmes, puis centièmes.","examples":["3,5 > 3,25"]},{"title":"Additionner et soustraire","content":"On aligne les virgules, on complète avec des zéros.","examples":["12,5 + 3,75 = 16,25","10 − 4,6 = 5,4"]},{"title":"× 10, 100, 1 000","content":"La virgule se décale vers la droite d'autant de rangs.","examples":["3,4 × 10 = 34","0,25 × 100 = 25"]}],"keyPoints":["Aligner les virgules","× 10 : virgule d'un rang à droite","Comparer de gauche à droite"],"cards":[{"q":"3,4 × 10 =","a":"34","explain":"","tag":""},{"q":"0,25 × 100 =","a":"25","explain":"","tag":""},{"q":"12,5 + 3,75 =","a":"16,25","explain":"","tag":""},{"q":"10 − 4,6 =","a":"5,4","explain":"","tag":""},{"q":"2,5 = ?","a":"2,50","explain":"","tag":""},{"q":"Le plus grand : 3,5 ou 3,25","a":"3,5","explain":"","tag":""},{"q":"÷ 10 ?","a":"Virgule d'un rang à gauche","explain":"","tag":""},{"q":"0,07 en fraction","a":"7/100","explain":"","tag":""}],"questions":[{"type":"calcul","q":"3,4 × 10 =","answer":"34","explanation":"Décalage.","level":1,"skill":"×10","hint":""},{"type":"calcul","q":"0,25 × 100 =","answer":"25","explanation":"Deux rangs.","level":2,"skill":"×100","hint":""},{"type":"calcul","q":"12,5 + 3,75 =","answer":"16.25","explanation":"Alignées.","level":1,"skill":"addition","hint":""},{"type":"calcul","q":"10 − 4,6 =","answer":"5.4","explanation":"10,0.","level":2,"skill":"soustraction","hint":""},{"type":"qcm","q":"Le plus grand est…","choices":["3,25","3,5","3,09","3,249"],"answer":1,"explanation":"Dixièmes.","level":1,"skill":"comparer"},{"type":"vf","q":"2,5 = 2,50.","answer":true,"explanation":"Zéro à droite.","level":1,"skill":"écriture"},{"type":"calcul","q":"4,5 ÷ 10 =","answer":"0.45","explanation":"Virgule à gauche.","level":2,"skill":"÷10","hint":""},{"type":"ordre","q":"Range du plus petit au plus grand.","items":["0,09","0,1","0,9","1,05"],"explanation":"Dixièmes.","level":2,"skill":"ranger"}]},{"level":"CM2","subject":"maths","catalogTitle":"Proportionnalité","title":"Proportionnalité","duration":25,"summary":"Tableau de proportionnalité, règle de trois simple, pourcentages simples.","objectives":["Reconnaître","Compléter un tableau","Pourcentages simples"],"prerequisites":["Multiplication"],"pitfalls":["Tableau non proportionnel"],"lesson":[{"title":"Reconnaître","content":"Deux grandeurs sont proportionnelles si on passe de l'une à l'autre en multipliant par le même nombre (coefficient).","examples":["2 kg → 5 € ; 4 kg → 10 €"]},{"title":"Règle de trois","content":"On passe par l'unité : si 3 stylos coûtent 6 €, 1 stylo coûte 2 €, donc 7 stylos 14 €.","examples":["5 cahiers : 10 € → 8 cahiers : 16 €"]},{"title":"Pourcentages","content":"10 % = ÷10 ; 25 % = ÷4 ; 50 % = ÷2 ; 100 % = tout.","examples":["25 % de 80 = 20"]}],"keyPoints":["Même coefficient","Retour à l'unité","50 %, 25 %, 10 %"],"cards":[{"q":"50 % ?","a":"La moitié","explain":"","tag":""},{"q":"25 % ?","a":"Le quart","explain":"","tag":""},{"q":"10 % ?","a":"Un dixième","explain":"","tag":""},{"q":"25 % de 80","a":"20","explain":"","tag":""},{"q":"10 % de 350","a":"35","explain":"","tag":""},{"q":"Retour à l'unité ?","a":"Calculer pour 1","explain":"","tag":""},{"q":"Coefficient ?","a":"Nombre qui multiplie","explain":"","tag":""},{"q":"Âge et taille proportionnels ?","a":"Non","explain":"","tag":""}],"questions":[{"type":"calcul","q":"3 stylos 6 € : 7 stylos coûtent (€)","answer":"14","explanation":"2 € l'unité.","level":1,"skill":"règle de trois","hint":""},{"type":"calcul","q":"5 cahiers 10 € : 8 cahiers (€)","answer":"16","explanation":"2×8.","level":1,"skill":"règle de trois","hint":""},{"type":"calcul","q":"25 % de 80 =","answer":"20","explanation":"÷4.","level":1,"skill":"pourcentage","hint":""},{"type":"calcul","q":"10 % de 350 =","answer":"35","explanation":"÷10.","level":1,"skill":"pourcentage","hint":""},{"type":"vf","q":"L'âge et la taille sont proportionnels.","answer":false,"explanation":"Non.","level":1,"skill":"reconnaître"},{"type":"qcm","q":"Quel tableau est proportionnel ?","choices":["2→6 ; 4→12","2→6 ; 4→10","1→2 ; 2→5","3→4 ; 6→9"],"answer":0,"explanation":"×3.","level":2,"skill":"reconnaître"},{"type":"trous","q":"50 % c'est la ___ .","answer":"moitié","accept":["moitie"],"explanation":"Moitié.","level":1,"skill":"pourcentage"},{"type":"calcul","q":"50 % de 70 =","answer":"35","explanation":"÷2.","level":1,"skill":"pourcentage","hint":""}]},{"level":"CM2","subject":"maths","catalogTitle":"Géométrie : tracés et constructions","title":"Géométrie : tracés et constructions","duration":25,"summary":"Perpendiculaires, parallèles, cercle, médiatrice simple; instruments.","objectives":["Tracer perpendiculaires et parallèles","Tracer un cercle","Médiatrice"],"prerequisites":["Droites"],"pitfalls":["Mauvaise équerre"],"lesson":[{"title":"Perpendiculaires et parallèles","content":"On trace une perpendiculaire avec l'équerre; une parallèle avec l'équerre et la règle (deux perpendiculaires à la même droite sont parallèles).","examples":["⊥ et //"]},{"title":"Cercle","content":"Centre, rayon, diamètre (2 × rayon), corde. On trace au compas.","examples":["r 